    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "common_0240_student_m_01",
      "hash64": "3A163871A3F1D00F",
      "text": "Me! Me! Can I ask a question?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "common_0240_student_m_02",
      "hash64": "3A163971A3F1D1C2",
      "text": "What’s your favorite thing about Pokémon?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "common_0240_select_06",
      "hash64": "8B4D10CBB8D7403B",
      "text": "I like battling with Pokémon",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "common_0240_select_07",
      "hash64": "8B4D0FCBB8D73E88",
      "text": "I like collecting Pokémon",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "common_0240_select_08",
      "hash64": "8B4D0ECBB8D73CD5",
      "text": "I like playing with my Pokémon",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "common_0240_select_14",
      "hash64": "8B498CCBB8D42A18",
      "text": "I like everything about Pokémon!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "common_0240_student_m_03",
      "hash64": "3A163A71A3F1D375",
      "text": "Really? Awesome! I’m totally the same!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "common_0240_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "2494BF56355716FA",
      "text": "Does anyone else have a question for their\\nnew classmate?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "common_0240_rival_01",
      "hash64": "04200D98BCE714A6",
      "text": "Me! I have a question![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "common_0240_rival_02",
      "hash64": "04200C98BCE712F3",
      "text": "You went to all the trouble of enrolling here, so\\nspill, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "common_0240_rival_03",
      "hash64": "04200B98BCE71140",
      "text": "What do you hope to get out of it? You must\\nhave some kind of dream, right?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "common_0240_select_09",
      "hash64": "8B4D0DCBB8D73B22",
      "text": "I want to complete the Pokédex",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "common_0240_select_10",
      "hash64": "8B4990CBB8D430E4",
      "text": "I want to be a strong Trainer",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "common_0240_select_11",
      "hash64": "8B4991CBB8D43297",
      "text": "I don’t actually know",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "common_0240_rival_03a",
      "hash64": "E984D588FCA21B13",
      "text": "I’m glad I got you set up with that Pokédex app if\\nyou like collecting that much![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "common_0240_rival_03b",
      "hash64": "E984D688FCA21CC6",
      "text": "You will be! Oh, I just know it! You and me—\\nwe’re going to get so strong battling together![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "common_0240_rival_03c",
      "hash64": "E984D788FCA21E79",
      "text": "Fair, I get it! The possibilities are endless, right?\\nWho can decide![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "common_0240_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "2494B256355700E3",
      "text": "Well, thank you for telling us a bit about\\nyourself, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\c\\nI’m Mr. Jacq. I teach biology here at the\\nacademy, and I’m also your homeroom teacher.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "common_0240_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "2494B1563556FF30",
      "text": "That’s your seat. Second row from the front.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "common_0240_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "249134563553F4F2",
      "text": "All right, you ragamuffins. Be nice and friendly\\nto our new classmate![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
